                    "number": "45",
                    "sid": "MAT 27:45"
                },
                "At noon the whole country was covered with darkness, which lasted for\nthree hours.\n",
                {
                    "type": "verse",
                    "marker": "v",
                    "number": "46",
                    "sid": "MAT 27:46"
                },
                "At about three o'clock Jesus cried out with a loud shout, ",
                {
                    "type": "char",
                    "marker": "tl",
                    "content": [
                        "“Eli, Eli,\nlema sabachthani?”"
                    ]
                },
                " which means, “My God, my God, why did you abandon me?”\n",
                {
                    "type": "verse",
                    "marker": "v",
                    "number": "46",
                    "sid": "MAT 27:46"
                },
                "At about three o'clock Jesus cried out with a loud shout, ",
